      "body": "> **Automated CI Conformance Mirror Notice**: Automated `IETF RFC 9421 / RFC 8941 Structured Fields` regression runner issue; manual pull requests from human engineers are not reviewed on this mirror.\n\n- **Escrow Rail**: https://algora.io / https://polar.sh / https://opire.dev\n- **Funding Status**: Held in escrow \u2014 Reward: $450 USDC (released automatically on green CI quorum)\n- **Specification Shards**: `shards/spec_01.json` .. `shards/spec_64.json`\n- **Companion Quorum Suite**: https://github.com/IES-BoilerRoom/solana-svm-cpi-conformance/issues/1\n\n### Problem Summary\n\n1. `canonicalize_http_sig_frames` in `http_sig/signature_base_builder.py` currently rejects frames whose byte length equals `frame_ceiling` (`VEC-14-EXACT-CEILING-BOUNDARY`).\n2. Align `SIGNATURE_PARAMS_NONCE` and `COVERED_DIGEST_ANCHOR` in `http_sig/signature_base_builder.py` (without modifying `suite/verify_rfc9421_quorum.py`) until `python3 suite/verify_rfc9421_quorum.py` passes all 24 vectors.",
